re aesthetic perfection. With its subtle curves and architectural lines, Verve seamlessly integrates into our <a href=\"https://studiobagno.com.au/soft-square-collection\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Soft Square Range</a>, offering a harmonious blend of form and function. The asymmetrical backrest of the Verve provides unparalleled comfort, cradling the neck and back for a truly indulgent bathing experience. Verve is available in Matte White, Semi Gloss White and Ash Grey.<br/></div><div><div><b>Made with MarmoTech</b></div><div>Constructed from a formulation of premium stone composite materials and 100% silica free, each bath undergoes a meticulous process, ensuring the highest standards of quality and durability. The result is a freestanding bath with a luxurious tactile finish, that not only feels exquisite but also warms quickly and helps maintains water temperature.</div></div><div><b>Notes:</b></div><div>-Overflow &amp; waste included<br/></div><div>-Plug &amp; Waste included as standard with bath: <a href=\"#/product/sku-sbw009-mw\">SBW009/MW</a></div></div>","sourceRecordCount":1,"captureDate":"2026-11-01","availability":null}
